Typing or pasting a bare URL into a Sheets cell left it as plain,
non-clickable text — unlike Docs, where PR #532 already unified
hyperlink handling. This adds render-time URL detection for Sheets:
a plain (non-formula) cell whose trimmed value is a single safe
http(s):// URL is painted in the theme link color and underlined,
and Ctrl/Cmd+Click opens it in a new tab (mirroring the Docs
editor). Detection is render/click-time only, so nothing is
persisted and the Store model is untouched.

